@startuml F5.9-ERRO-02-sobreposicao-periodo
title F5.9-ERRO-02 — 422 sobreposição de período letivo
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CalendarController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Salvar período
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /academico/periodos
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: checar intervalo
Postgres --> Ctrl: sobrepõe 2026/2
note right of Ctrl
  sem BEGIN TX
end note
Ctrl --> WebApp: 422 period_overlap
WebApp --> Sec: mensagem com conflito

@enduml
